// Checkbox, AS GRAPH SOURCE (#3678, epic #3604) — a pure shared/ui control authored as DATA. Its
// `provides: "@/shared/ui/controls/Checkbox"` makes the runtime loader vendor THIS over the bundled module (registered code
// is the fallback). Transcribed verbatim; deps stay registered code.
